      <description align="left" color="yellow" colored="false" height="130" width="650" x="35" y="310">Read-only viewer for actual WS4 native preparation:319795 rows,19 regular attributes,4 numeric columns. No target role assigned, no transformations, sampling, model training or writes. Use Results Auto Model:Predict, HeartDisease target, positive Yes,18 inputs. Native Auto Model workflow/results will be recorded separately from prior direct-learner benchmarks.</description>
